# openHC feature: restore — on-box return to stock for the HC-250. The work is
# the restore Rust package (features/restore/packages): `restore stock` sets the
# EEPROM restore request that the SD install's bootohc reads, and reboots into
# Control4's factory restore. It needs only reboot, which busybox provides, so
# this half adds no Buildroot package.
